notes.content:
- fixed a bug where achievements were not issued for completing the game in ARCADE and SURVIVAL levels(if you completed the game in these levels complete any mission to get achievements);
- fixed a bug where "empty" missions were displayed in the task log;
- fixed a bug with displaying a capsule explosion on Mission 105;
- fixed a bug where some consumables thrown out by the character could disappear when selecting them back;
- fixed issue with the player getting stuck in the environment and cannot move on some missions.

The current update adds the ability to reassign control keys in the settings menu.

Also:
- added the ability to quickly throw a grenade (g key);
- added Steam achievements for completing each level of difficulty;
- added the information line about the difficulty level and current mission during the battle (for streams);
- fixed a bug with all NPCs disappearing when manually loading a save made after completing a training mission;
- fixed animation of death of some monsters;
- removed incorrect explosion animation when picking up drones from the floor;
- fixed a bug with incorrect highlighting of unavailable abilities in the fusion gun improvement window;
- fixed crashes on some missions.

- added difficulty levels;
- added possibility of automatically picking up of items;
- fixed the sale price of ammunition stacks by dragging and dropping;
- you can no longer put consumables on the crafting table if you drag them from the table to replace them;
- fixed a critical bug that sometimes broke equipment when loading saves;
- fixed a cache trigger that didn't work on Mission 93; 
- fixed player getting stuck on some missions; 
- fixed not displaying the name and description of the unique STING M10;
- fixed an issue that sometimes caused the loss of equipped weapons.
